<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Kevco at $12 a share.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Kevco at $12 a share.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kevco Inc were priced at $12 each for the company's initial public offering of 2.1 million shares.</p>
<p>The shares priced in the middle of the estimated pricing range of $11 to $13.</p>
<p>The company also granted the underwriters an over-allotment option for an additional 315,000 shares. Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc and Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc are managing the offering, the company said.</p>
<p>Kevco is a wholesale distributor of building products to the manufactured housing and recreational vehicle industries.</p>
